# Hosts that refuse CI link checkers but open in a browser (checked by hand on 2026-10-26).
# mckinsey.com answers bots with an HTTP/2 protocol error.
^https://www\.mckinsey\.com/
# elibrary.imf.org answers bots with 403/405; the IMF Survey 2006 flexicurity article opens in a browser (checked 2026-10-27).
^https://www\.elibrary\.imf\.org/
# cmr-journal.org serves its certificate without the Let's Encrypt intermediate, so rustls-based checkers reject it;
# browsers fetch the intermediate and open the PDF (checked 2026-10-27).
^https://www\.cmr-journal\.org/
# gesetze-im-internet.de (German federal statutes) times out from GitHub runners but opens in a browser (checked 2026-10-28).
^https://www\.gesetze-im-internet\.de/
# scholarspace.manoa.hawaii.edu (DSpace) times out from CI intermittently; the PDF opens in a browser (checked 2026-10-28).
^https://scholarspace\.manoa\.hawaii\.edu/
